# Public GisCode Core: text files are LF in the repository and in every working
# copy, so what a contributor clones is byte-for-byte what the exporter wrote.
# The private development tree keeps its own line endings; this file is only
# written into the export.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries: never normalise, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gguf binary
